["Grant County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/grant-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grant County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/grant-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows October to November came in under 90% of normal in 43 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids, same as September to October. On the middle of the grids, every pair published so far in 2026 came in under 90% of normal, with June to July at 51% in 2026 and February to March at 55% in 2026. Grid 31316 had its driest year in 2002 at 55% of normal.</p>"}
